---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../components/CtaBanner.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Our Story & Commitment | Ezra Maroc"
  description="Discover who we are, our passion for reconnecting individuals to their heritage, and the values that guide our commitment alongside you."
  currentPage="about"
  pageCSS={['a-propos']}
>
    <main id="main-content" class="page-banner">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Our Story, Your Bridge to Morocco</h1>
            <p>Discover who we are, our passion for reconnecting individuals to their heritage, and the values that guide our commitment alongside you.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section id="histoire" class="section about-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title internal-title">At the Roots of <span>Ezra Maroc</span></h2>
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-image">
                    <picture>
                    <source srcset="../img/logo.webp" type="image/webp">
                    <img src="../img/logo.png" alt="Ezra Maroc Logo" width="751" height="721">
                </picture>
                </div>
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p>Founded with a clear mission, <strong>Ezra Maroc</strong> was born from direct observation of the challenges faced by those wishing to reconnect with their Moroccan roots. We saw the frustration with complex administrative processes, often perceived as a daunting labyrinth.</p>
                    <p>Especially for the diaspora, whose ties to Morocco sometimes span generations and continents, obtaining nationality represents much more than a formality: it is an <strong>affirmation of identity</strong>, a <strong>bridge to cultural heritage</strong>. Ezra Maroc was created to transform this difficult journey into an accessible and serene path.</p>
                    <blockquote class="about-quote">
                         "Simplifying access to Moroccan nationality is our job and our passion."
                    </blockquote>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="mission" class="section mission-section alt-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Fundamental <span>Mission</span></h2>
            <div class="mission-content">
                <p class="mission-statement">To be your expert and caring partner in transforming administrative complexity into a clear path towards your Moroccan citizenship.</p>
                <div class="mission-commitments">
                    <h3>Our concrete commitments:</h3>
                    <ul class="commitment-list">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> <strong>Make Accessible</strong>: Remove obstacles for all those legitimately entitled to nationality.</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> <strong>Value Connections</strong>: Recognize and strengthen historical and cultural connections with Morocco.</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> <strong>Serve with Excellence</strong>: Provide cutting-edge legal expertise and top-tier human support.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="equipe" class="section team-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Team of <span>Experts</span></h2>
            <p class="team-intro">A synergy of skills dedicated to your project, combining legal know-how, administrative knowledge, and human commitment.</p>
            <div class="team-grid">
                <div class="team-category">
                    <div class="category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Legal Experts</h3>
                    <p>Mastering the Nationality Code, they build the strategy for your file.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="team-category">
                    <div class="category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-landmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Admin. Specialists</h3>
                    <p>They master administrative procedures and documentary requirements.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="team-category">
                    <div class="category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-signature" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Client Advisors</h3>
                    <p>Your dedicated contact, ensuring personalized follow-up.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="team-category">
                    <div class="category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-tree" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Genealogy Experts</h3>
                    <p>Mobilized to find essential proof and documents.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="team-category">
                    <div class="category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-language" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Sworn Translators</h3>
                    <p>Ensuring the linguistic compliance of your official documents.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="team-commitment">Our collective strength: a shared passion for reconnecting individuals to their Moroccan history.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="methodologie" class="section methodology-section alt-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Proven <span>Methodology</span></h2>
            <p class="methodology-intro">The <strong>"EZRA MAROC PROJECT"</strong> approach combines rigor and adaptability to maximize your chances of success:</p>
            <div class="methodology-pillars">
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gavel" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Legal Analysis</h3>
                    <p>Precise diagnosis of your eligibility and tailored strategy.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Admin. Procedures</h3>
                    <p>Rigorous collection and preparation of every part of the file.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Support</h3>
                    <p>A dedicated contact guides and informs you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-rocket" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Proactive Management</h3>
                    <p>Anticipation and rapid resolution of potential roadblocks.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Active Local Network</h3>
                    <p>Our partners in Morocco facilitate on-the-ground procedures.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="valeurs" class="section values-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our <span>Values</span></h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Excellence</h3>
                    <p>We strive for perfection in every file, with constantly refined expertise and impeccable service quality.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-glasses" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Transparency</h3>
                    <p>Open and honest communication guarantees you full visibility on the progress of your application.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Integrity</h3>
                    <p>We act with strict ethics, ensuring legal compliance and the confidentiality of your file.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <h3>Empathy</h3>
                    <p>We understand the personal importance of your project and offer respectful and attentive support.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="engagement" class="section engagement-section alt-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Commitment: <span>Your Success</span></h2>
            <div class="engagement-content">
                <p>At Ezra Maroc, obtaining your nationality certificate isn't the end; it's the beginning of a new chapter. We are invested in your success because your reconnection to your roots is also our greatest reward.</p>
                <p>Trust a team that treats your project with the seriousness and attention it deserves, transforming your aspiration into a tangible reality.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="engagement-actions">
                <a href="services.html" class="btn btn-primary">Discover Our Services in Detail</a>
                <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-outline">Speak with an Advisor</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to take the first step towards your Moroccan citizenship?</h2>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="contact.html#contact-form-container" class="btn btn-light">Request a Free Evaluation</a>
                <a href="faq.html" class="btn btn-outline-light">See Frequently Asked Questions</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
  <CtaBanner lang={lang} />
</BaseLayout>
